# The ONE reviewed Relay source commit for the independent budget ledger schema
# (docs/runbooks/relay-worker-budget-authority.md, step 3). The bundle renderer
# exports 001-005 from exactly this commit, and both standalone Jobs refuse a
# mounted bundle whose source-commit differs. Empty refuses. The operator sets the
# full 40-character SHA of the reviewer-merged release commit here, in a reviewed
# PR, and nowhere else. Only comments, blank lines and this one assignment.
RELAY_BUDGET_SOURCE_COMMIT=
